    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 In the game, the player will play the role of the &quot;Tester&quot; who travels from reality to the &quot;Land of Evolution&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each game, players will have to pass six levels and defeat the final BOSS to win and become the &quot;God of Evolution&quot; candidate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Traditional overhead barrage shooting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 15 side quests are randomly generated, and each round has a different experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 hot-swappable chips turn the skill mechanism on its head</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Match 20 bloodlines with you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overhead corner barrage play:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565290/extras/2e6df0ce39b05caf9a59f202977233b9.avif?t=1755506428\" width=352 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pedigree matching:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565290/extras/0f72cfd7a6c483871d71b7c80f07af0a.avif?t=1755506428\" width=324 height=318 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can build their own BD by matching different bloodlines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Magical chemical reactions can occur between different bloodlines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the same bloodline can trigger the ultimate evolution of a pure blood bloodline</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Different lineages can also induce the mutation and evolution of lineages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill system:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 All skills can be inserted into the chip to change their skill form</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Skill trajectories, attributes, and ballistic attributes can be freely matched</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 In the game, the player will play the role of the &quot;Tester&quot; who travels from reality to the &quot;Land of Evolution&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each game, players will have to pass six levels and defeat the final BOSS to win and become the &quot;God of Evolution&quot; candidate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Traditional overhead barrage shooting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 15 side quests are randomly generated, and each round has a different experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 hot-swappable chips turn the skill mechanism on its head</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Match 20 bloodlines with you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overhead corner barrage play:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565290/extras/2e6df0ce39b05caf9a59f202977233b9.avif?t=1755506428\" width=352 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pedigree matching:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565290/extras/0f72cfd7a6c483871d71b7c80f07af0a.avif?t=1755506428\" width=324 height=318 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can build their own BD by matching different bloodlines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Magical chemical reactions can occur between different bloodlines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the same bloodline can trigger the ultimate evolution of a pure blood bloodline</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Different lineages can also induce the mutation and evolution of lineages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill system:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 All skills can be inserted into the chip to change their skill form</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Skill trajectories, attributes, and ballistic attributes can be freely matched</p>",
    "short_description": "Infinite Evolution is a bullet-screen game that overlooks corner rouge. Multiple combinations of &quot;skills&quot; and skillchips can't be stopped, and lineage combinations, evolution or mutation&quot;are at your disposal. The game has a variety of infinite stream and Gangz-like Settings and content experiences.",
